254
00:44:06.770 --> 00:44:09.795
Ma ei tahaks,
et ta rohkem haiget saaks.

255
00:44:26.640 --> 00:44:29.700
Üks jama on veel.

256
00:44:29.800 --> 00:44:34.200
See IT -mees Mildeberg,
tal on minu kohta lindistus salajaste

257
00:44:34.200 --> 00:44:35.960
